{"type":"text","timestamp":1785132531437,"sessionID":"ses_05dd15714ffeNZFcHcbzvPrbds","part":{"id":"prt_fa230abeb001YkyxxHIq7JQZ4N","messageID":"msg_fa23097a2001tEBTOUS7rmVTqD","sessionID":"ses_05dd15714ffeNZFcHcbzvPrbds","type":"text","text":"**Yes, all expenses in the October Meeting on October 8, 2019 were approved.**\n\nThe meeting had 3 expenses, all with `approved = true`:\n\n| Expense Description | Cost | Date | Approved |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Posters | $54.25 | 2019-10-01 | true |\n| Water, chips, cookies | $69.33 | 2019-10-08 | true |\n| Pizza | $51.81 | 2019-10-08 | true |\n\n**Final Answer:** Yes, each expense in the October Meeting on October 8, 2019 was approved (3/3 expenses approved).\n\n**Evidence SQL:**\n```sql\nSELECT COUNT(*) AS total_expenses, SUM(CASE WHEN approved = 'true' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS approved_count\nFROM expense e\nJOIN budget b ON e.link_to_budget = b.budget_id\nJOIN event ev ON b.link_to_event = ev.event_id\nWHERE ev.event_name = 'October Meeting' AND ev.event_date LIKE '2019-10-08%'\n```","time":{"start":1785132526572,"end":1785132531426}}}
